                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The dataset contains an inventory of the bills of exchange to the East of the Dutch East Indian Company (VOC) during the period 1690-1720. It includes the following data: names and occupations of the clients, brokers, benificiaries, types of currencies and information on the salaries of the VOC employees.</p>"
